<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen Inc cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amgen Inc cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it cut its rating on Amgen Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cut its 1998 earnings estimate to $3.25 a share from $3.40.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, Amgen and Regeneron Pharmaceuticals Inc said their drug for treating Lou Gehrig's disease had failed to show efficacy in a Phase III trial.</p>
</text>
